<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ログイン - インシデント管理システム</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0284c7;
            --primary-hover: #0369a1;
            --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 50%, #0f172a 100%);
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #0f172a;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-gradient);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .login-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        .brand-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .brand-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .brand-title {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        .brand-sub {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin: 0;
        }
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }
        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #334155;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }
        .input-wrapper {
            position: relative;
        }
        .input-control {
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
            background: #f8fafc;
        }
        .input-control:focus {
            outline: none;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.2);
        }
        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.85rem;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-submit:hover {
            background: var(--primary-hover);
        }
        .btn-submit:active {
            transform: scale(0.99);
        }
        .footer-link {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            padding-top: 1.2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .footer-link a {
            color: var(--primary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .footer-link a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="login-card">
        <div class="brand-header">
            <div class="brand-icon">🚨</div>
            <h1 class="brand-title">インシデント管理システム</h1>
            <p class="brand-sub">ログインしてシステムを開始してください</p>
        </div>

        <form action="/api/login" method="POST">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>ユーザーID（ログイン名）：</label>
                <div class="input-wrapper">
                    <input type="text" name="loginId" class="input-control" placeholder="例: staff01" required autofocus>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label>パスワード：</label>
                <div class="input-wrapper">
                    <input type="password" name="password" class="input-control" placeholder="パスワードを入力" required>
                </div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">ログインする</button>
        </form>

        <div class="footer-link">
            アカウントをお持ちでない方はこちら<br>
            <a href="/register" style="display:inline-block; margin-top:0.4rem;">👤 新規ユーザー登録</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
